 testing proxygen proxygen  coro proxygen  coro  test   
 
co test status1xxfiltertest  ignore1xxresponses    
  insequence seq  
 
  mockhttpsource mocksource  
 
  expect call mocksource  readheaderevent    
       times 3  
       willrepeatedly folly  coro  gmock helpers  coinvoke  
               -  folly  coro  task httpheaderevent headers1xx   std  make unique httpmessage     
            headers1xx- setstatuscode 100   
            headers1xx- getheaders   add  testname    testvalue    
            co httpheaderevent std  move headers1xx expect call mocksource  readheaderevent    
       times 1  
       willonce      -  folly  coro  task httpheaderevent headers200   std  make unique httpmessage     
        headers200- setstatuscode 200   
        headers200- getheaders   add  co    ro    
        co httpheaderevent std  move headers200 headerevent   co await mocksource readheaderevent    
  expect headerevent headers- is1xxresponse     
 
    
  status1xxfilter filter1xx  
  filter1xx setsource  mocksource   
 
    
  headerevent   co await filter1xx readheaderevent    
  expect headerevent headers- is1xxresponse     
  expect eq headerevent headers- getstatuscode    200   
  expect headerevent headers- getheaders   exists  co     
  
